# Applies when building clovy-api/Dockerfile with the repository root as the
# context (the only supported invocation). Allowlist: the clovy-api workspace
# and the shared companion wire-protocol crate, nothing else.
*
!clovy-api/**
!crates/clovy-companion-protocol/**
clovy-api/target
clovy-api/deploy
clovy-api/.github
crates/clovy-companion-protocol/target
**/*.md
!clovy-api/crates/services/src/prompts/*.md
# Local env files hold real provider keys. CI checkouts have none, but local
# `make ephemeral-api` builds do, and the chef/planner stages copy the whole
# workspace - without this they land in the builder cache. Secrets reach a CVM
# only via Phala sealed env, never via the image.
clovy-api/.env
clovy-api/.env.*
